I recommend to use **graphviz** to do this:

```graphviz
digraph G {
    rankdir=TB;
    subgraph L {
        rank = same;
        a -> b [dir=back];  // b ← a
    }
    subgraph R {
        rank = same;
        c -> d;  // c → d
    }
    a -> c
}
```

